# Raw source photography and logo originals.
# Only the curated, renamed copies under assets/img/ are used by the site.
# Leading slashes anchor these to the repo root — without them, Git on Windows
# (case-insensitive) would also exclude assets/img/yoga, /leadership and /logos.
/Yoga/
/Leadership/
/Energy & Spatial Consultant/
/Logos/

# Source asset already inlined into the pages as SVG markup
/whatsapp-svgrepo-com.svg

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Dependencies (none currently, but guard against stray installs)
node_modules/
